  <h1>Terms</h1>
  <p>Last updated 13 November 2026.</p>

  <h2>Using the site</h2>
  <p>
    The free exercises, hints and function pages are free to use for learning. You do not need an
    account for them.
  </p>

  <h2>Accounts</h2>
  <p>
    An account keeps your progress on every device. Keep your password to yourself. You can delete
    your account at any time on the <a href="/account/">account page</a>.
  </p>

  <h2>PRO</h2>
  <p>
    PRO opens the exercises marked PRO. Payments go through Stripe. PRO paid monthly, every 3
    months, every 6 months (no longer sold) or yearly is a subscription that renews by itself until
    you cancel. Cancel at any time from your account: PRO stays until the end of the period you paid
    for, and you are not charged again. Lifetime PRO is one payment and does not renew.
  </p>

  <h2>No warranty</h2>
  <p>
    The site checks formulas with its own grader, which follows Excel's documented behaviour. It
    can differ from Excel in some cases, and the expected values have not all been checked in
    Excel. Check important work in Excel itself.
  </p>

  <h2>Trademarks</h2>
